The repository map (src/map.rs) follows the design of Aider's repo map,
https://github.com/Aider-AI/aider (aider/repomap.py), and uses its edge
weights and budget defaults. Aider is Copyright Paul Gauthier and is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0; a copy of the licence is at
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0. No Aider source code is
included; the design and weights were reimplemented in Rust.

jouet's secret scanning (the jouet-secrets crate) uses gitleaks' detection
rules, https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks: its config/gitleaks.toml is
vendored unchanged as crates/jouet-secrets/gitleaks/gitleaks.toml, and the
way rules, entropy, allowlists, stopwords and .gitleaksignore fingerprints
are applied follows gitleaks. gitleaks is distributed under the following
